    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hopkins Ward are delighted to present this beautifully presented one-bedroom artisan cottage, tucked away just off Cork Street in one of Dublin 8`s most vibrant and sought after neighbourhoods.\n\nBright, characterful and seriously well located, this 38 sq. m. home combines original cottage charm with contemporary finishes. High ceilings and excellent natural light create a surprisingly spacious feel, while the extra large bedroom with fitted wardrobes is a real stand out.\n\nThere`s also a clever pull down stair providing access to valuable additional attic storage perfect for keeping city living clutter free.\n\nOutside your door, you have Cork Street`s cafés, shops and everyday amenities, with the Red Line LUAS virtually on your doorstep and free on-street parking directly outside.\n\nCharacter. Convenience. Location. And unmistakably Dublin 8.\n\nA genuinely unique city home that needs to be seen to be appreciated.\n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
